The free-will buddy (vision M10 §10, slice P2a): one yes from the owner and
the agent dresses itself and shapes its own identity and soul.

`[persona] free` joins the schema (the Looks page's "Let it be itself" switch;
PersonaConfig, group Agent, default off). The `look` and `identity` tools from
the overlay (crates/caelza-tools/src/look.rs, identity.rs) are declared,
attributed as plugins, listed in the inventory and registered for every agent
but Cael, the guide; the prompt's tool list gets their two lines (trimmed to
the tools the agent has). The tools read the switch from the config file at
each call, so the yes needs no restart. The docs' tool table gets their row,
the dashboard's strings get the Looks page's switch card, and the web test list
gets persona.logic.test.ts.

